{"lines": ["How is Adolf Hitler connected to Shrek?", "In nineteen thirty-three, Hitler shook hands with President Hindenburg, the old war hero who had just made him chancellor.", "In nineteen seventeen, Hindenburg studied war maps with his boss, Kaiser Wilhelm the Second, the last emperor of Germany.", "In nineteen ten, the Kaiser took Teddy Roosevelt on horseback to watch the German army practice.", "Teddy Roosevelt was the 26th president, and the line runs all the way to the 40th, Ronald Reagan.", "In nineteen eighty-four, Reagan met a bodybuilder turned movie star, Arnold, at the Republican convention in Dallas.", "In two thousand nine, Arnold walked with Obama in Los Angeles.", "In twenty eleven, Obama hosted Prince Charles in the Oval Office.", "In twenty twenty-five, the King met Canada's Mark Carney.", "Who made an ad with Mike Myers.", "Who voices Shrek."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.38], ["is", 0.38, 0.64], ["Adolf", 0.64, 0.88], ["Hitler", 0.88, 1.3], ["connected", 1.3, 1.8], ["to", 1.8, 2.22], ["Shrek?", 2.22, 2.8], ["In", 3.82, 3.88], ["1933,", 3.88, 4.44], ["Hitler", 4.94, 5.02], ["shook", 5.02, 5.36], ["hands", 5.36, 5.56], ["with", 5.56, 5.78], ["President", 5.78, 6.18], ["Hindenburg,", 6.18, 6.74], ["the", 7.04, 7.22], ["old", 7.22, 7.36], ["war", 7.36, 7.54], ["hero", 7.54, 7.84], ["who", 7.84, 8.14], ["we", 8.14, 8.24], ["just", 8.24, 8.42], ["made", 8.42, 8.66], ["him", 8.66, 8.76], ["Chancellor.", 8.76, 9.04], ["In", 9.9, 9.98], ["1917,", 9.98, 10.5], ["Hindenburg", 11.3, 11.8], ["studied", 11.8, 12.22], ["war", 12.22, 12.5], ["maps", 12.5, 12.72], ["with", 12.72, 13.02], ["his", 13.02, 13.14], ["boss,", 13.14, 13.44], ["Kaiser", 13.74, 13.9], ["Wilhelm", 13.9, 14.24], ["II,", 14.24, 14.82], ["the", 15.04, 15.12], ["last", 15.12, 15.3], ["emperor", 15.3, 15.62], ["of", 15.62, 15.86], ["Germany.", 15.86, 16.18], ["In", 16.9, 17.0], ["1910,", 17.0, 17.5], ["the", 18.0, 18.12], ["Kaiser", 18.12, 18.32], ["took", 18.32, 18.64], ["Teddy", 18.64, 18.8],